# Thunderous Velocipede: "Each other Vehicle and creature you control enters with an additional +1/+1 counter on it if its mana value is
# 4 or less. Otherwise, it enters with three additional +1/+1 counters." Bot1's Memnite (mana value 0) enters as a 2/2 and Arrogant Wurm
# (mana value 5, 4/4) as a 7/7. The Velocipede itself gets none (it is not "other"), and Bot2's Memnite, under Bot2's control, is still 1/1.

